sequenceDiagram
  actor Human
  participant CLI
  participant App
  participant Core
  participant Agent
  participant Tools
  participant Store
  Human->>CLI: task + acceptance criteria
  CLI->>App: create task/run
  App->>Store: configuration snapshot + run.started
  App->>Core: advance normative phases
  Core->>Agent: implementation request + grants
  Agent->>Tools: authorized actions
  Tools-->>Store: invocations + evidence
  Core->>Tools: verification checks
  Core->>Agent: independent review request
  Core->>Human: gate request bound to ChangeSet digest
  Human-->>Core: approve/reject/request changes
  Core->>Store: decision + closure + trace
